  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for fishermen to create awareness and promote conservation of East Pacific leatherback turtles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient organize a visit of fisherman and government officials from EP leatherback foraging ground countries to Mexico or Costa Rican leatherback nesting beaches and organize a workshop on best handling and release practices for these participants during their visit to Mx or CR.</narrative>
  </description>
